{"id":"648494","name":"fu豇豆腊肉叶儿粑","author":"食·色","authorId":"34360","desc":"","cover":"images/648494/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"fu豇豆","amount":"100克"},{"name":"煮好的腊肉","amount":"150克"},{"name":"姜蒜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"2根"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"叶儿粑粉","amount":"410克"},{"name":"水","amount":"360克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"馅料：fu豇豆100克，煮好的腊肉150克，姜蒜末适量，葱两根，生抽适量，盐适量，白糖适量，蚝油适量。","img":"images/648494/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"fu豇豆用清水泡发后洗净。","img":"images/648494/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入电饭煲蒸屉中蒸软。","img":"images/648494/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"出锅晾凉。","img":"images/648494/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切碎备用。","img":"images/648494/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将腊肉分开皮，瘦肉，肥膘，分别切成小丁。","img":"images/648494/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅烧热，放入腊肉肥膘，煸炒出油。","img":"images/648494/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"肥膘煸至半干，拨到一边，加入姜蒜末炒香，再与肥膘混合。","img":"images/648494/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加豇豆末，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/648494/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"再放入腊肉翻炒均匀。","img":"images/648494/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加少量水，生抽，盐，糖，蚝油，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/648494/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"翻炒至水汽变干，加入葱花，","img":"images/648494/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"翻炒均匀，熄火。","img":"images/648494/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"出锅，晾凉备用。","img":"images/648494/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"面团：叶儿粑粉410克，水3600克，玉米衣若干。","img":"images/648494/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"将水与粉一起倒入大碗。","img":"images/648494/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"揉成软硬适度的面团。","img":"images/648494/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"分割成14等分。","img":"images/648494/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"按扁成圆片，放入馅料。","img":"images/648494/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"包好，收口。","img":"images/648494/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"整理成椭圆形，放在玉米衣上。","img":"images/648494/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"剪去玉米衣超长的部分，摆入蒸屉。","img":"images/648494/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"放在